<title>INDIA: India November gold output above target.</title>
<headline>India November gold output above target.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 182.77 kg of gold in November 1996 against a target of 165.23 kg, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The country produced 1,280 kg of gold during April-November 1996 compared to 1,097.21 kg in the same period last year, the statement said.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   November 1996		 Cumulative production</p>
<p>    ----------------------	  ----------------------</p>
<p>	  Target     Actual	    Apr-Nov 96  Apr-Nov 95</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> BGML    72.73     53.49		451.13	 420.70</p>
<p> HGML    92.50    129.28		828.87	 676.51</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total  165.23    182.77	     1,280.00     1,097.21</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in kg and provisional.</p>
<p>	    BGML: Bharat Gold Mines Limited.</p>
<p>	    HGML: Hutti Gold Mines Limited.</p>
</text>
